+        // SBFB S77 fork: pipeline layer-split partial load. Load ONLY the weights of the
+        // layers in [shard_layer_start, shard_layer_end) (TENSOR_SKIP for the rest) so a
+        // node allocates VRAM for its shard only. shard_layer_end == 0 => n_layer. For
